  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "OAuth test helpers for EasyReasy.Auth's OAuth 2.1 authorization server. OAuthTestClient drives an app's OAuth 2.1 authorization server the way an MCP client and the app's consent page do (register, authorize, approve or deny as a signed-in person, redeem, refresh, revoke), throwing OAuthTestFlowException with the OAuth error on any refusal, and InMemoryOAuthServerStore stands in for the app's IOAuthServerStore. Requires EasyReasy.Auth 5.17.0. See https://github.com/AdamTovatt/easy-reasy/blob/auth-testing-v1.1.0/EasyReasy.Auth.Testing/README.md",
